WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Jamie begins raw Rush under the falling Ryu.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.300
Crouching heavy punch catches Ryu late in the fall.

3
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.550
Jamie cancels the juggle into Drive Impact.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.400
Drive Impact hits while Ryu remains in the juggle.

5
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.700
Ryu is knocked down after the Impact hit.
